EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-1uv5gi_csk-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-12r55p_shared-v6-vector-consumer/README.md:7:Own tests/test_protocol_conformance.py plus focused vector adapters and fixtures that do not duplicate product logic. Consume the exact reviewed rc.6 candidate suite at immutable merged curator-spec commit 432eb2ee1fe2d6b271e37269f867c8851c325539 through the caller-supplied CURATOR_CONFORMANCE_ROOT, whose manifest.json must hash to sha256:12e58b82579645ba1ccafba49d3e2dd3216005ddf37ae63c68a9fafd46773071 and whose release/1.0.0-rc.6.json records the same required_manifest_sha256; do not edit the committed curator-spec checkout ref in this task. Read every in-scope schema-v6, go-v1, policy, claim-qualification, expected build-driver, and manager-lifecycle artifact from that root; never hard-code a vector input the way Curator internal/godriver/controls_test.go does. Cover generated schema cases for both manifest names, agent-skill-v6 and csk-skill-v6, receipt build-receipt-v1, marker install-marker-v2, conformance-claim-v3, vectors/build-drivers.json, vectors/go-host-execution-policy.json, vectors/conformance-claim-v3-qualification.json, the 11-file expected/build-driver/ tree, and vectors/manager-lifecycle.json. build-receipt-v2, install-marker-v3, schema v7 and the external-repository and registry surfaces belong to the go-repository-v1 line and are out of scope here. The official manager suite pin remains on the previous released protocol until TASK-260720-25d05o qualifies the release and TASK-260720-1utsx8 audits the promotion. Do not import or copy Curator implementation code and do not fabricate release or conformance claims. Accepted immutable-root prerequisites: TASK-260720-3ag6pi and BUG-260731-2rhy74 are independently accepted done. curator-spec PR #15 merged at GitHub-verified commit 432eb2ee1fe2d6b271e37269f867c8851c325539 with 8/8 Ubuntu/macOS/Windows checks green and publishes the required manifest digest plus expanded 32-case manager lifecycle. Treat this as candidate evidence only: do not create a tag, GitHub Release, released-suite pin, or conformance claim in this task.
